TIP:  Play slowly, with a soft rhythm.

INTRO:  For the intro strum the chord beginning with the note/string shown (may not transpose).  Untransposed it's downstroke the (A) beginning with the 5th string, then pick the 5th string, and the 6th string twice.  Repeat this two more times.  For the final (A) strum the top 3 strings.

TIP:  Notice the use of the No Chord (NC).  You can just play the preceding chord if you want but Merle sings a cappella at these points.


